proxy.description:
The proxy herald's own requests go through: "environment", the
host's `HTTPS_PROXY` and `NO_PROXY` where it honours them; "none";
or a proxy's http or https URL. "environment" where absent.

replies.description:
Whether answers to `latest` and `changelog` are posted to the room;
Matrix has no answer seen by one member alone, so `ephemeral` answers
in a thread under the command.
